            "review_title": "Review at Nguyen Loan Fish Noodle",
            "review_text": "Kate\nNha Trang, Vietnam137 contributions\n0\nDelicious Fish and Jelly fish Noodle!\nSep 2020\n\"Bun ca sua\" is an delicious dish that famous in Nha Trang. There're many restaurants or small places selling this in this beautiful city. But the one in Nguyen Loan restaurant's the best in my opinion!\nThe fish and the jellyfish's very fresh, the soup is tasty. The jellyfish is not too hard or too soft when u bite it.\nJust one thing: the restaurant's quite hot and small, so sometimes, it's too crowded.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten September 11, 2020",
