            "review_text": "MJC\nOrange County, California18 contributions\n0\nFavorite for Fish Cake noodle soup\nJan 2020 • Couples\nWife has been here many times in the past for the soup so wanted to take me on our visit to Nha Trang. She says the soup is as good as ever while I opted for the (large) deep fried dumplings which were stuff with pork, onion and mushrooms. Very good. Next had Banh Mi. The bread was very good but the meat was boiled while I prefer grilled on my sandwich. Still, it was tasty and fresh. A lot of locals came by while we were there as well as many takeouts so you figure it has to be good...\nRead more\nWritten January 2, 2020",
