            "review_title": "Review at Nguyen Loan Fish Noodle",
            "review_text": "Stephystephy\nHong Kong, China108 contributions\n0\nJelly noddles is good\nApr 2019 • Couples\nThere are a lot of good restaurants on Ngo Gia Tu and this is one of the famous one.My husband tried the fish noodle and I tried the jelly.\n\nThe noodles and soup base is tasty but he didn't like the fish since its too salty to him. We live in a place where fish balls are fresh and abundant so maybe this is not that special. \n\nHowever, I liked my jelly a la carte. Its a clear broth with lots of transparent jelly in it. I'd never taste jelly cooked this way and I like it. Its good to give it a try!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 13, 2019",
