            "review_title": "Review at Nguyen Loan Fish Noodle",
            "review_text": "Justinh-90\nMelbourne, Australia26 contributions\n0\nSo good we came two days in a row!\nMay 2018\nCame here after reading the reviews on trip advisor and was not disappointed! They only sell two things. The fish cake noodles and banh mi with siu mai. The noodles are amazing and the jellyfish add a very unique texture. Each main was only 35000d, less than 2aud per bowl. The side salad is fresh and the owner is also really friendly. Even showing us how to eat the build your own banh mi siu Mai’s. you won’t be disappointed coming here. If you don’t have a Vietnamese friend, ask for the menu, they have a small a4 sign thing that has the translations. It’s packed with locals for a reason!\nRead more\nWritten May 24, 2018",
